          return `In addition, unitary operations must act <em data-svelte-h="svelte-qkn600">linearly</em> on the state, i.e. \\[U(\\alpha|0\\rangle + \\beta|1\\rangle) = \\alpha U|0\\rangle + \\beta U|1\\rangle\\]`;
